# Ours-Fast's files, sha256, paths relative to the weights layout root.
# Model files (nnUNet_results/) are stored in this repository under weights/fast/ (checkpoints as parts of
# at most 90 MiB); scripts/assemble_weights.py joins them into $FILAMENT_WEIGHTS and checks each against this file.
# Generated from SOURCE_CHECKPOINTS.sha256 (training paths -> layout paths):
#   nnunet_env/nnUNet_results/<rest>  -> nnUNet_results/<rest>
# with ONE change: the 2 nnU-Net fold_0/checkpoint_final.pth hashes are those of the STRIPPED inference-only copies
# (optimizer_state, grad_scaler_state, logging and _best_ema removed; every network tensor and inference key equal;
# weights/README.md "Stripped nnU-Net checkpoints"). SOURCE_CHECKPOINTS.sha256 keeps the as-stored hashes as provenance.
# Every other entry (plans/dataset JSON) is byte-identical to its source and keeps its hash.
# The selector bag (selector/) ships at weights/selector/ and is checked in place;
# filament_seg.selector_stage refuses to unpickle a released bag whose sha256 differs from this file.
